1
00:00:00,975 --> 00:00:02,475
(Howard:)-Really?
-Yes.

2
00:00:02,643 --> 00:00:04,483
(Sheldon:)You're either with me or against me.

3
00:00:04,645 --> 00:00:06,755
(Amy:)You want to take the bus to work?

4
00:00:08,716 --> 00:00:09,886
(Sheldon:)Maybe there's a third option.

5
00:00:12,453 --> 00:00:16,163
(Amy:)FYI, I had a doughnut
for breakfast, you jerk.

6
00:00:18,626 --> 00:00:20,626
(Leonard:)So now we're just waiting
for the data

7
00:00:20,795 --> 00:00:24,335
(Leonard:)from the ship to be crunched, but the
numbers look pretty promising.

8
00:00:24,498 --> 00:00:28,348
(Howard:)That's so great. If you guys prove
the existence of Unruh radiation--

9
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:30,412
Hey, hey, hey!
My eyes are up here.

10
00:00:32,773 --> 00:00:35,843
(Sheldon:)Howard, Raj, Judas.

11
00:00:36,978 --> 00:00:39,688
(Penny:)You know what?
You're a crazy person.

12
00:00:39,847 --> 00:00:41,847
(Sheldon:)A crazy person with a long memory,

13
00:00:42,016 --> 00:00:44,996
(Sheldon:)and if all goes according to plan,
a robot army.

14
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:48,100
(Bernadette:)-Stop it.
-Or a mutant army.

15
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:50,706
(Sheldon:)It depends on how
my Kickstarter goes.

16
00:00:52,193 --> 00:00:54,473
I said stop it!

17
00:00:54,629 --> 00:00:56,769
(Howard:)Now, listen to me.

18
00:00:56,931 --> 00:01:00,021
(Howard:)You two aren't just friends.

